    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLTRS</strong> is an experimental and artistic game that invites players to discover and explore pleasure through an intuitive, sensory, and short experience. Designed as a meditative and interactive journey, the game transforms education into an act of play, curiosity, and empowerment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>one-button gameplay</strong> and <strong>a peaceful, aesthetic world</strong>, CLTRS offers a unique perspective on pleasure, intimacy, and body awareness. Through <strong>symbolic interactions</strong> and <strong>fluid exploration</strong>, the game provides an opportunity to reconnect with a part of the body too often overlooked.</p>",
